nd Phoenix. Each spirit can be launched independently at a targeted area of effect. Affected enemy units take damage over time and have their attack speed greatly reduced.", "notes_zh": ["烈火精灵现在到达目标区域后将获得1秒的视野。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hp_cost_perc", "spirit_duration", "spirit_speed", "radius", "duration", "attackspeed_slow", "damage_per_second", "spirit_count", "tick_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phoenix_sun_ray", "name_zh": "凤凰·烈日炙烤", "name_en": "Sun Ray", "description_zh": "凤凰以损失生命能量为代价，向前射出一束炽热的光线炙烤敌人。光线对敌人造成伤害，并且能治疗友军，伤害和治疗的数值均为基础数值加上目标最大生命值的一定百分比。随着光线不断炙烤，百分比也会不断增加。", "description_en": "Phoenix expels a beam of light at the cost of its own health. The beam damages enemies and heals allies for a base amount plus a percentage of their max health. The percentage increases as the beam continues to fire.", "notes_zh": ["烈日炙烤的宽度为%radius%，长度为%abilitycastrange%。", "凤凰受到眩晕、沉默、飓风、妖术或睡眠等效果时烈日炙烤将会中断。", "凤凰可以使用物品和其他技能，不会打断烈日炙烤。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "超新星期间可以施放烈日炙烤。", "en": "Allows Sun Ray to be cast during Supernova."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hp_cost_perc_per_second", "base_damage", "hp_perc_damage", "base_heal", "hp_perc_heal", "radius", "tick_interval", "forward_move_speed", "turn_rate_initial", "turn_rate", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "phoenix_dying_light", "name_zh": "凤凰·消逝之光", "name_en": "Dying Light", "description_zh": "凤凰每秒对%radius%范围内所有敌人造成%damage_pct%%%自身缺失生命值的魔法伤害。", "description_en": "Phoenix deals %damage_pct%%% of its missing health as magic damage to all enemies in a %radius% radius every second.", "notes_zh": ["消逝之光在凤凰变身为超新星期间也会造成伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["radius", "damage_pct", "tick_interval"]}, {"subject": "phoenix_supernova", "name_zh": "凤凰·超新星", "name_en": "Supernova", "descri